vilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h932LMdhtAsQ7kNvwHXefAB&_nc_oc=Adlae03k1eu-4LknTcR5ukUQDH0HTas-BeUwq_quputkgjXUVECE1LirUR_SY9Xnjt8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfymmuVgdIxKHV1nz3POGihLHG4FdvKi9FwN8Pb2dxyC4Q&oe=69B2B9D4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aoRWBZkJJVIQ7kNvwG6c_3K&_nc_oc=AdmnAL0bU4NjIbDfW51tzImoq-FvqUisY2LV7vW-mzO8uMnsamC6pNTgoR0DgXHaPFE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzPty0mjFK5a11o5vPO0Tm8rgxqvoM-K-BLlhH85E7euw&oe=69B2BEB2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TCSeBSB3KOgQ7kNvwHyd2Cf&_nc_oc=AdmD8eXZ3aXdFWlqvFXzTJV3x19iXwN9UpUonU4-rNOTHTmH78OqHU-1AuUKMgqfVfQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyiuYBHifb0cr5om56IfNLRU0lj002NfVQ8equra4Mcsg&oe=69B2CC55"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "614292642460347", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "